---
/**
 * The memory loop: agents remember → inbox → nightly sleep → canon, chronicle, disputes → the human rules.
 * Pure SVG with classes (no inline styles), themed by guides.css through the design tokens.
 */
---
<figure class="guide-figure">
  <div class="guide-figure__scroll">
    <svg class="gd" viewBox="0 0 860 430" role="img" aria-labelledby="loop-title loop-desc">
      <title id="loop-title">The Hippocampus memory loop</title>
      <desc id="loop-desc">
        Agents remember into the inbox. Each night the sleep pass reads the inbox: small language-model steps find mentions and
        claims, and deterministic code reconciles and applies them. It writes canon notes, the chronicle, and dispute notes. Disputes
        go to the human, whose ruling becomes canon. Agents read canon back at any time with recall, get, ask_canon and briefing.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="loop-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="gd__head" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="loop-head-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="gd__head gd__head--accent" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="loop-head-gold" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="gd__head gd__head--gold" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Reads: any time, straight from canon -->
      <path d="M745 40 V24 H90 V176" class="gd__edge gd__edge--read" marker-end="url(#loop-head)" />
      <text x="420" y="16" class="gd__label" text-anchor="middle">agents read canon any time: recall · get · ask_canon · briefing</text>

      <!-- Writes -->
      <path d="M160 222 C215 222 295 205 295 156" class="gd__edge" marker-end="url(#loop-head)" />
      <text x="222" y="248" class="gd__label" text-anchor="middle">remember</text>
      <path d="M370 112 H426" class="gd__edge" marker-end="url(#loop-head)" />
      <text x="399" y="102" class="gd__label" text-anchor="middle">nightly</text>

      <!-- Sleep outputs -->
      <path d="M600 90 C630 90 630 72 656 72" class="gd__edge gd__edge--accent" marker-end="url(#loop-head-accent)" />
      <path d="M600 112 C630 112 630 160 656 160" class="gd__edge gd__edge--accent" marker-end="url(#loop-head-accent)" />
      <path d="M600 134 C625 134 625 248 656 248" class="gd__edge gd__edge--accent" marker-end="url(#loop-head-accent)" />

      <!-- The human -->
      <path d="M745 280 C745 340 660 362 604 362" class="gd__edge gd__edge--gold" marker-end="url(#loop-head-gold)" />
      <text x="754" y="322" class="gd__label">ruling needed</text>
      <path d="M602 392 H832 Q845 392 845 379 V85 Q845 72 834 72" class="gd__edge gd__edge--gold" marker-end="url(#loop-head-gold)" />
      <text x="720" y="414" class="gd__label" text-anchor="middle">your ruling becomes canon</text>

      <!-- Nodes -->
      <g class="gd__node gd__node--party">
        <rect x="20" y="180" width="140" height="84" rx="10" />
        <text x="90" y="212" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">The party</text>
        <text x="90" y="232" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">agents in lanes</text>
        <text x="90" y="250" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">MCP or GitHub</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node">
        <rect x="220" y="70" width="150" height="84" rx="10" />
        <text x="295" y="102" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">Inbox</text>
        <text x="295" y="122" class="gd__mono" text-anchor="middle">inbox/&lt;agent&gt;/</text>
        <text x="295" y="140" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">raw episodes</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node gd__node--accent">
        <rect x="430" y="56" width="170" height="112" rx="12" />
        <text x="515" y="88" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">Nightly sleep</text>
        <text x="515" y="110" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">LLM: mentions, claims</text>
        <text x="515" y="128" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">code: reconcile, apply</text>
        <text x="515" y="148" class="gd__sub gd__sub--muted" text-anchor="middle">failures stay in the inbox</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node gd__node--canon">
        <rect x="660" y="40" width="170" height="64" rx="10" />
        <text x="745" y="66" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">Canon notes</text>
        <text x="745" y="86" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">facts · relations · quests</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node">
        <rect x="660" y="128" width="170" height="64" rx="10" />
        <text x="745" y="154" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">Chronicle</text>
        <text x="745" y="174" class="gd__mono" text-anchor="middle">chronicle/YYYY/MM/</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node gd__node--disputed">
        <rect x="660" y="216" width="170" height="64" rx="10" />
        <text x="745" y="242" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">Disputes</text>
        <text x="745" y="262" class="gd__mono" text-anchor="middle">disputes/*.md</text>
      </g>
      <g class="gd__node gd__node--human">
        <rect x="430" y="320" width="170" height="84" rx="10" />
        <text x="515" y="352" class="gd__title" text-anchor="middle">You, the human</text>
        <text x="515" y="372" class="gd__sub" text-anchor="middle">Council or Obsidian</text>
        <text x="515" y="390" class="gd__sub gd__sub--muted" text-anchor="middle">outranks every agent</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Agents write fast, raw <em>episodes</em>. The nightly sleep turns them into canon, a day-by-day chronicle, and disputes for you
    to settle. Everyone reads canon back whenever they need it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
